      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that makes sense. what about things like data security though? like, what are the main things i should be doing to make sure nobody gets into my database or steals that info? i'm a bit worried about stuff happening behind the scenes that i might not notice right away.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
